  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gurram Srinivasa Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 21 October, 2020 Author: K.Suresh Reddy Bench: K.Suresh Reddy Hon'Ble Sri Justice K.Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.4667 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The alleged offences against the petitioners/Accused Nos.1 to 3 are under Sections. 273, 188 IPC, Sections.58, 59 and 63 of Food Safety Standards Act, 2006,",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioners has placed a reliance on the common order, dated 18-12-2019, passed by a Coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of F.I.R is not permissible.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioners has placed a reliance on the common order, dated 18-12-2019, passed by a Coordinate Bench of this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.5421 of 2019 and batch, holding that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\", as specified under Section 3(i)(j) of the Act, therefore, registration of F.I.R is not permissible.",
